       'Six unreadable operative line endings; Gazette day token partly hidden. No estimate of a missing-word count.',
       'Root and independent auditor read original56 and300dpi crop directly. Only expression1 notification is declared source-incomplete; this is NOT a claim that all69pages were operatively read. Six whole-word[illegible]markers retain the physically clipped loci after post, after the(in exercise...), after Evacuee in Act-name parenthesis, after pleased, after EvacueeProperty in destination office, and after WestPakistan. Actual wording elsewhere remains literal; neither expected formula words nor repeated proper names supplied. Refetchacquisition_attempt218 on7NovemberPKT returned identical6888324bytePDF SHA06c9627234683325116fdd8f9f9ac186ced50b94be2a0d6d9f33a9e72cf16122. Notification date21December1957 visible, exact modern legal status unknown.',
